# 41_as_of
# `as_of` pins a read to a system-time epoch. In the reference semantics a Z-set is a
# snapshot already, so the operator is the identity here and the epoch is a fact about
# *which* snapshot the engine hands it — which is one level below this one, and is where
# the anchoring tests live.
1 10 100 x1
1 10 null x1
2 20 200 x1
3 30 null x1
